  "summary": "Taipei 101 is a 508-metre skyscraper in Taipei, Taiwan, completed in 2004. Taipei city government says construction began in 1998, while another source gives a 1999–2004 construction period with the tower topped out in October 2003 and opened on 31 December 2004. It was the world's tallest building from 2004 to 2010.",
