  "reviewer_note": "No model: no tower plan or base width found on an opened page. The OSM outline for 台北101 (147 x 138 m) is the podium/complex, so it was not used. Start year conflicts (1998 vs 1999). Thornton Tomasetti returns HTTP 403 to spotcheck (opened via WebFetch; 508-meter, 2004, 2004-2010 stated there); Infrastructure Index spotchecks 508, 2010 and the dates. 508 m is stated by Thornton Tomasetti (\"508-meter\") and Infrastructure Index.",
